# Test: boot refuses an external plugin's section that lacks a mandatory leaf
#
# Question: does `ze start` refuse a config whose section under an external
# plugin's own root lacks the leaf the plugin's module marks mandatory, with
# the module's own check, and exit with a failure before the plugin reaches
# Stage 2?
# Why not a unit test: the module comes from the plugin process at Stage 1 and
# is joined on the boot path before the full parse. Only a start of the binary
# shows that boot holds the module when it judges the section, and that the
# daemon itself ends refused.
#
# This was step 3 of external-yang-boot-accepts-what-offline-refuses.ci. The
# exit expectation there is file-level and judged the daemon of another step,
# so this step's own exit was never asserted. Here it is the only command, and
# the exit check reads its exit, as test/plugin/bgp-bfd-profile-undefined-boot.ci
# does for a refused BGP boot.
#
# VALIDATES: AC-10 of spec-plugin-external-yang-at-startup, for a mandatory
#   leaf at boot.
# PREVENTS: boot starting a plugin without a value its module requires.

# The fixture variant valid-config-refused brings the same module and expects
# ze to refuse the config: the connection that closes with Stage 1 unanswered
# is its normal end, and a daemon that reports ready is its failure.
#
# refused=config-yang-missing declares the body a config Ze must refuse, for
# the repository config sweep (TestRepositoryConfigsValidate), which judges it
# with the module published as boot holds it and asserts that code. The runner
# writes the file as it does any other.
tmpfs=mandatory.conf:refused=config-yang-missing:terminator=EOF_MANDATORY
bus {
	endpoint acme-monitor {
		external {
			run "le test fixture plugin/external-yang valid-config-refused";
		}
		encoding json;
	}
}

acme-monitor {
	interval 6
}
EOF_MANDATORY

# Boot refuses the section without the mandatory leaf, with the module's
# check. The plugin never reaches Stage 2.
cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze start mandatory.conf:timeout=30s
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stderr:contains=mandatory field "target" is missing
reject=stderr:contains=FIXTURE: external-yang configure root=acme-monitor leaves=[acme-monitor/interval=6
reject=stderr:contains=unknown top-level keyword
reject=stderr:pattern=ZE-OBSERVER-FAIL
